#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: Largo Caballero's course of revolutionary class struggle and a worker alliance with the <span style="color: #700000;">**PCE**</span> are our primary goals.
- @centrist: Julián Besteiro's orthodox Marxism remains the best way to resolve our internal contradictions.
- @labor: We should work with the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> to improve the lives of organized workers.
- @reform: Following Indalecio Prieto, we should collaborate with the republicans, strengthen democracy, and expand the party's electorate.
- @socpat: Pursue a fusion of <span style='color: #c00000;'>socialism</span> and national unity above class politics.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 8; communist_coalition += 1; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent += 5; ceda_relation -= 3; radical_relation -= 5; izq_rep_relation -= 3; nationalization_support += 1; pce_relation += 3

The Caballerista left of the party supports a course of class struggle, and potentially a worker alliance with the <span style="color: #700000;">**PCE**</span>.

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 8; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

The Besteiristas, followers of Julián Besteiro's orthodox Marxism, support a middle course: preparing the party for eventual socialism while building up the consciousness of the working class, and rejecting both premature revolution and bourgeois collaboration.

@labor
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labor") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labor"; labor_strength += 8; center_dissent += 5; wtb_support += 1; labor_dissent -= 5; pce_relation -= 3

The <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> wing of the party supports continued participation in government in order to provide benefits to organized workers, and the creation of public works programs for employment.

@reform
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "reformist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "reformist"; reformist_strength += 8; democratization += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent += 5; ceda_relation += 5; radical_relation += 5; izq_rep_relation += 5; pce_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1

The Prietista wing of the party seeks to preserve the Republic through collaboration with the republican parties, and is most supportive of coalitions with the other pro-Republic forces.

@socpat
view-if: social_patriot
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socpat") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socpat"; social_patriot_strength += 10; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 10; reformist_dissent += 5; ceda_relation += 6; radical_relation += 6; izq_rep_relation += 6; pce_relation -= 15

This small current within the party, regarded by many as unprincipled accommodationists, argues that the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> should set aside class politics in favor of national unity.

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
